    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wathi kuMose: Khwela uze eNkosini wena kanye loAroni loNadabi loAbihu labalisa bakoIsrayeli abangamatshumi ayisikhombisa, lingikhonze likhatshana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NguMose yedwa ozasondela eNkosini, kodwa bona kabayikusondela; labantu bonke kabayikukhwela kanye laye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose weza wabatshela abantu wonke amazwi eNkosi lezahlulelo zonke; bonke abantu baphendula ngalizwi linye bathi: Sizakuwenza wonke amazwi iNkosi ewakhulume kithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose waseloba wonke amazwi eNkosi. Wavuka ekuseni, wakha ialtare phansi kwentaba kanye lensika zokukhonzela ezilitshumi lambili ezilingana izizwe zakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathuma insizwa zabantu bakoIsrayeli ukuba zinikele iminikelo yokutshiswa, zihlabele iNkosi imihlatshelo yokuthula yezinkabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wathatha ingxenye yegazi, wayithela emiganwini; lengxenye wayikhaphazela ealtareni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathatha incwadi yesivumelwano, wayibala phambi kwabantu. Bathi: Konke iNkosi ekutshiloyo sizakukwenza, silalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wasethatha igazi, walikhaphazela ebantwini, wathi: Khangelani igazi lesivumelwano iNkosi esenze lani ngawo wonke lamazwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
